<title>USA: Great Northern raises quarterly payout.</title>
<headline>Great Northern raises quarterly payout.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PAUL, Minn. 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Great Northern Iron Ore Properties said on Monday it had raised its third quarter distribution to $1.60 a share from $1.15 in the second quarter.</p>
<p>The distribution is payable October 31, record September 30, Great Northern said.</p>
<p>-- Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
